4. **✅ Provider annotated with feature flag** - `StripePaymentProvider` annotated with `@FeatureFlagged("payments.stripe.enabled")` for emergency kill switch

5. **✅ Tests mock Stripe SDK** - Stub mode implementation enables testing without credentials, integration tests use real Stripe test API

